  "caveats": "The research was conducted by The Population Health Unit, Kenya Medical Research Institute - Wellcome Trust Research Programme. Please refer to the nature article [\"A spatial database of health facilities managed by the public health sector in sub Saharan Africa\"](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41597-019-0142-2) for specific information about the methods, data records, technical validation, usage notes and code availability of the data",
